Package: ramshield
Version: 0.6.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Depends: python3, curl, systemd
Maintainer: RamShield <contact@ramshield.io>
Description: RamShield Autonomous Ingress Defense
 RamShield is a DDoS mitigation reverse proxy and enforcement layer.
 It operates at the network edge to detect and block malicious traffic.
 .
  Safe-mode (userspace, no XDP) available via --safe-mode flag.
  Production deployments should use XDP kernel programs for full throughput.
Homepage: https://github.com/grep999/ramshield
